menu "ML307C diagnostic probe"

config ML307C_PROBE_ENABLE_DUMP_SAVE
    bool "Enable documented ML307C crash Dump saving during this diagnostic run"
    default n
    help
        After confirming the expected module version and querying MDUMPCFG,
        send AT+MDUMPCFG=1 and read it back. This changes the module's crash
        recovery behavior. It does not enable continuous AP/CP logging.
        Keep disabled in the default read-only enumeration build.

endmenu
